// Judgment of Junil (docs/DECKS.md 7.3, 9.1, 10.4, 14: the Scales of Junil reworked; a good card,
// band II; it needs Orders from Heaven, as the Scales did). Name a civilization: for 20 turns
// there is no war between your team and its, enforced both ways. A war between them ends at once.
// Neither can declare war on the other, and nothing else starts one (defensive pacts, vassals,
// events, False Colours); hidden units of either cannot attack the other. Once a game.
// Rules: crates/ffh-core/src/ffh/cards/world_spells_2.rs (the truce: `Team::truce_until`).
