    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_JUDGMENT_OF_JUNIL_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]World spell, once a game: Judgment of Junil.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Name a civilization you have met: for 20 turns there is no war between you and it. A war between you ends at once.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Neither of you can declare war on the other, and nothing else starts that war: defensive pacts, vassals, events and False Colours do not. Hidden units of either cannot attack the other.",
